prompt: 
Create a digital science-fiction movie poster showing a futuristic city at night under a giant ringed planet. A lone person stands on a rooftop in the foreground, looking toward a massive futuristic tower in the center of the city. Use sharp vertical and geometric lines on the skyscrapers to create a powerful futuristic feeling, while diagonal lines from the flying spacecraft and roads guide the viewer's eyes toward the central tower. Use rectangular and triangular shapes throughout the buildings and leave areas of negative space in the dark sky to make the city feel enormous. Give the buildings smooth metallic and glass textures, while the rooftop has a rough, wet texture that reflects the surrounding lights. Make the skyscrapers, spacecraft, and central tower appear three-dimensional by emphasizing their volume and depth. Use strong contrast between the dark blue-black sky and the bright orange and blue lights throughout the city. The central tower and the lone figure should be the main focal points because they have the strongest contrast and brightest lighting. The overall poster should create a mysterious, dramatic, futuristic, and slightly lonely mood.
